1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,050
Official: Hello, Tourist Information Centre, Mike speaking, how can I help you?

2
00:00:06,050 --> 00:00:10,791
Woman: Oh, hi. I wanted to find out about cookery classes.

3
00:00:10,791 --> 00:00:14,670
I believe there are some one-day classes for tourists?

4
00:00:14,670 --> 00:00:18,740
Official: Well, they're open to everyone, but tourists are always welcome.

5
00:00:18,740 --> 00:00:22,440
OK, let me give you some details of what's available.

6
00:00:22,440 --> 00:00:27,250
There are several classes. One very popular one is at the Food Studio.

7
00:00:27,250 --> 00:00:28,850
Woman: OK.

8
00:00:28,850 --> 00:00:30,575
Official: They focus on seasonal products,

9
00:00:30,575 --> 00:00:35,750
and as well as teaching you how to cook them, they also show you how to choose them.

10
00:00:35,750 --> 00:00:40,160
Woman: Right, that sounds good. How big are the classes?

11
00:00:40,160 --> 00:00:43,670
Official: I'm not sure exactly, but they'll be quite small.

12
00:00:43,670 --> 00:00:46,990
Woman: And could I get a private lesson there?

13
00:00:46,990 --> 00:00:53,420
Official: I think so... let me check, yes, they do offer those

14
00:00:53,600 --> 00:00:53,634
Though in fact most of the people

15
00:00:53,634 --> 00:00:58,880
who attend the classes find it's a nice way of getting to know one another.

16
00:00:58,880 --> 00:01:01,540
Woman: I suppose it must be, yes.

17
00:01:01,540 --> 00:01:05,033
Official: And this company has a special deal for clients

18
00:01:05,395 --> 00:01:09,410
where they offer a discount of 20 percent if you return for a further class

19
00:01:09,410 --> 00:01:13,440
Woman: OK. But you said there were several classes?

20
00:01:13,440 --> 00:01:18,940
Official: That's right. Another one you might be interested in is Bond's Cookery School.

21
00:01:18,940 --> 00:01:22,820
They're quite new, they just opened six months ago

22
00:01:22,820 --> 00:01:24,625
but I've heard good things about them.

23
00:01:24,625 --> 00:01:28,100
They concentrate on teaching you to prepare healthy food

24
00:01:28,100 --> 00:01:31,020
and they have quite a lot of specialist staff.

25
00:01:31,020 --> 00:01:35,660
Woman: So is that food for people on a diet and things like that

26
00:01:36,120 --> 00:01:38,170
I don't know if I'd be interested in that.

27
00:01:38,170 --> 00:01:43,454
Official: Well, I don't think they particularly focus on low calorie diets or weight loss.

28
00:01:43,454 --> 00:01:47,329
It's more to do with recipes that look at specific needs,

29
00:01:47,329 --> 00:01:51,580
like including ingredients that will help build up your bones

30
00:01:51,580 --> 00:01:53,670
and make them stronger, that sort of thing.

31
00:01:53,670 --> 00:01:58,740
Woman: I see. Well, I might be interested, I'm not sure

32
00:01:59,180 --> 00:02:01,140
Do they have a website I could check?

33
00:02:01,140 --> 00:02:04,979
Official: Yes, just key in the name of the school - it'll come up.

34
00:02:04,979 --> 00:02:07,840
And if you want to know more about them

35
00:02:08,060 --> 00:02:10,590
every Thursday evening they have a lecture at the school.

36
00:02:10,590 --> 00:02:14,973
It's free and you don't need to book or anything, just turn up at 7:30.

37
00:02:14,973 --> 00:02:19,630
And that might give you an idea of whether you want to go to an actual class.

38
00:02:19,630 --> 00:02:26,204
Official: OK, there's one more place you might be interested in.

39
00:02:26,204 --> 00:02:26,300
That's got a rather strange name

40
00:02:26,640 --> 00:02:34,570
it's called The Arretsa Centre - that's spelled A-R-R-E-T-S-A.

41
00:02:34,570 --> 00:02:36,350
Woman: OK.

42
00:02:36,350 --> 00:02:39,098
Official: They've got a very good reputation.

43
00:02:39,098 --> 00:02:41,980
They do a bit of meat and fish cookery

44
00:02:41,980 --> 00:02:45,380
but they mostly specialise in vegetarian dishes.

45
00:02:45,380 --> 00:02:50,420
Woman: Right. That's certainly an area I'd like to learn more about

46
00:02:50,940 --> 00:02:51,299
I've got lots of friends

47
00:02:51,299 --> 00:02:56,640
who don't eat meat. In fact, I think I might have seen that school today

48
00:02:56,960 --> 00:02:58,610
Is it just by the market?

49
00:02:58,610 --> 00:03:02,970
Official: That's right. So they don't have any problem getting their ingredients.

50
00:03:02,970 --> 00:03:09,510
They're right next door. And they also offer a special two-hour course in how to use a knife.

51
00:03:09,510 --> 00:03:13,716
They cover all the different skills - buying them, sharpening, chopping techniques.

52
00:03:13,716 --> 00:03:19,070
It gets booked up quickly though so you'd need to check it was available.

53
00:03:19,070 --> 00:03:24,000
Woman: Right, well thank you very much. I'll go and...
